wakatime-cli (0.6.1~git20260727) UNRELEASED; urgency=medium

  * Modernize packaging to debhelper-compat 13.
  * Fix build: build against go modules directly with proper -ldflags
    (version/commit/build-date were previously not injected and the
    build target didn't match debian/install's expected binary path).
  * Add AppStream metainfo (debian/com.github.wakatime.wakatime-cli.metainfo.xml)
    with hicolor scalable icon, validated with appstreamcli --pedantic.
  * Generate and install a man page via help2man.
  * Add debian/source/format (3.0 (quilt)); drop debian/compat in
    favor of debhelper-compat.
  * Bump Standards-Version to 4.6.2; add Rules-Requires-Root: no.

